Output .github/demo.gif

Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 1200
Set Height 600
Set Padding 20
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 35ms

Hide
Type "export PS1='$ ' && clear"
Enter
Show

Type "cargo run --example validate"
Enter
Sleep 4s

Type "cargo run --example datatypes"
Enter
Sleep 3s
